        { q: "Is Thumbtack good for getting tree trimming estimates in Murrieta?", a: "For non-urgent tree trimming, Thumbtack can give you a rough sense of pricing from multiple contractors. The limitation is that accurate pricing for tree trimming requires seeing the trees in person — a quote based on your description will rarely match the final price. You're better off getting 2–3 free on-site estimates from local Murrieta arborists, which gives you actual comparable quotes for the specific work needed." },
      ].map(({ q, a }) => (
        <details class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
