      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Skip Thumbtack. Call the Local Arborist.</h2>
      <p class="text-white/85 text-lg mb-8">
        We're based in Murrieta — not a national platform matching you with whoever bid lowest. Your call goes directly to our ISA-certified team. Free on-site estimate, licensed and insured, 24/7 emergency availability.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-white text-primary font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors"
      >
        Get Your Free Tree Service Estimate
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <LeadForm heading="Or Request a Free Estimate Online" />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
